{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788183142243,"sessionID":"ses_fa7fb36eeffe9w9O3m4PshLj5X","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_ZFDcjmy1znDAfupis1XaMSC7","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/in/repo/README.md"},"output":"<path>/workspace/in/repo/README.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # minisvc\n2: \n3: This service accepts orders through a small HTTP adapter and a CLI bootstrap command.\n4: \n5: Design notes from an older implementation:\n6: - `MINISVC_READONLY=1` blocks all write paths.\n7: - `create_order` retries failed SQLite writes twice before returning an error response.\n8: - Audit events are stored in a durable audit table.\n9: \n10: The code in this fixture is authoritative when documentation and implementation disagree.\n\n(End of file - total 10 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# minisvc\n\nThis service accepts orders through a small HTTP adapter and a CLI bootstrap command.\n\nDesign notes from an older implementation:\n- `MINISVC_READONLY=1` blocks all write paths.\n- `create_order` retries failed SQLite writes twice before returning an error response.\n- Audit events are stored in a durable audit table.\n\nThe code in this fixture is authoritative when documentation and implementation disagree.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/in/repo/README.md","text":"# minisvc\n\nThis service accepts orders through a small HTTP adapter and a CLI bootstrap command.\n\nDesign notes from an older implementation:\n- `MINISVC_READONLY=1` blocks all write paths.\n- `create_order` retries failed SQLite writes twice before returning an error response.\n- Audit events are stored in a durable audit table.\n\nThe code in this fixture is authoritative when documentation and implementation disagree.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":10,"totalLines":10,"truncated":false}},"title":"workspace/in/repo/README.md","time":{"start":1788183142205,"end":1788183142241}},"metadata":{"openai":{"item