{"type":"text","timestamp":1788183147394,"sessionID":"ses_fa7fb36eeffe9w9O3m4PshLj5X","part":{"id":"prt_058056fe5001LVCdPzfyqwdF85","messageID":"msg_058055fb4001NvIbNDC0EpNGor","sessionID":"ses_fa7fb36eeffe9w9O3m4PshLj5X","type":"text","text":"I’ve confirmed the fixture repo is mounted at `/workspace/in/repo`. The service is very small, with active runtime code in `cli.py`, `config.py`, `api/handlers.py`, `api/routes.py`, `audit.py`, and `storage/repo.py`; the `__init__.py` files are package markers only.","time":{"start":1788183146469,"end":1788183147390},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_06db62a57846ffec016a95826a488887d2a0a906b829833dcb","phase":"commentary"}}}}
